# Developer-only options for the dev server. Copy what you need into
# .env.development.local (git ignores it), never into .env or .env.local:
# .env.development.local is read only by `npm run dev`, not by the LAN demo's
# dev server or by a build.
#
# The fly-in camera: fly freely round the house, the viewpoint tour and plan
# views, ?view= and ?pose= in the address. Off, every visitor arrives as their
# chimp in the entry hall. Production builds never have it, even built with it.
# VITE_ENABLE_FLY_IN=true
